From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Fri Jul 29 15:05:03 2022
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Fri, 29 Jul 2022 15:05:03 +0000
Subject: Re: Computational Efficiency Discrepancy
Message-ID: <xHHU--VCQSo.FAgQ6J35AgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <xHHU--VCQSo.rzHX7cbaAgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
References: <xHHU--VCQSo.rzHX7cbaAgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
